settings-profile-will-use = { $file } is used when you save.
settings-profile-pick-prompt = Use this picture
settings-profile-save = Save changes
settings-profile-saving = Saving…
settings-profile-reset = Reset
settings-profile-save-failed = The profile was not saved. { $reason }

## Appearance

settings-appearance-title = Appearance
settings-appearance-theme = THEME
settings-appearance-theme-dark = Dark
settings-appearance-theme-coal = Coal
settings-appearance-theme-light = Light
settings-appearance-theme-system = System
settings-appearance-theme-note = The theme is part of your account, so Fluxer on your other devices follows it. System follows the light or dark setting of this computer.
settings-appearance-display = MESSAGE DISPLAY
settings-appearance-cozy = Cozy
settings-appearance-cozy-hint = Avatars, names and a little air between messages.
settings-appearance-compact = Compact
settings-appearance-compact-hint = The time before the name, no avatars: more messages on the screen.
settings-appearance-font-size = MESSAGE FONT SIZE
settings-appearance-px = { $size } px
settings-appearance-sample = This is how a message looks at this size.
settings-appearance-spacing = SPACE BETWEEN MESSAGE GROUPS
settings-appearance-spacing-note = Only in the cozy display. The font size and the spacing are part of your account too.
settings-appearance-zoom = ZOOM
settings-appearance-zoom-note = Zoom belongs to this computer, not to your account. The zoom keys change it from anywhere in Inlet.

## Messages and media

settings-media-title = Messages and media
settings-media-animations = ANIMATIONS
settings-media-gif = Play GIFs by themselves
settings-media-gif-note = With this off a GIF shows its first picture. The image viewer still plays it.
settings-media-emoji = Animate custom emoji
settings-media-stickers = Animate stickers
settings-media-links = LINKS AND REACTIONS
settings-media-embeds = Show embeds and link previews
settings-media-embeds-note = Previews are fetched by the instance, never from the site itself.
settings-media-reactions = Show reactions under messages
settings-media-spoilers = SPOILERS
settings-media-spoilers-click = Click to reveal a spoiler
settings-media-spoilers-always = Always show spoilers

## Privacy

settings-privacy-title = Privacy
settings-privacy-dms = DIRECT MESSAGES
settings-privacy-dms-from-members = Allow direct messages from members of servers
settings-privacy-dms-note = This is the default for servers you join. A server you already joined keeps its own setting, which you change in Fluxer.
settings-privacy-friends = WHO CAN SEND YOU A FRIEND REQUEST
settings-privacy-friends-anyone = Everyone
settings-privacy-friends-of-friends = Friends of friends
settings-privacy-friends-servers = Members of servers you are in
settings-privacy-friends-none = With all three off, nobody can send you a friend request.
settings-privacy-friends-note = You can still send friend requests yourself.

## Advanced

settings-advanced-title = Advanced
settings-advanced-developer = DEVELOPER
settings-advanced-developer-mode = Developer mode
settings-advanced-developer-note = Adds Copy ID to the menus of messages and people.
settings-advanced-id = YOUR USER ID
settings-advanced-copy-id = Copy ID

## Accounts

settings-accounts-title = Accounts
settings-accounts-signed-in = SIGNED IN
settings-accounts-shown = Shown now
settings-accounts-switch = Switch to this account
settings-accounts-sign-out = Sign out
settings-accounts-note = Inlet can be signed in to up to ten accounts, on one instance or several. Accounts you are not looking at stay quiet in the background and still notify you.
